@baseUrl = http://localhost:59244

### Read records incrementally. Use curl --no-buffer when this client buffers responses.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/local-service/stream?chunks=5&intervalMilliseconds=250
Accept: application/x-ndjson

### Maximum record count, without scheduled delays
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/local-service/stream?chunks=100&intervalMilliseconds=0

### Invalid combined duration returns HTTP 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/local-service/stream?chunks=100&intervalMilliseconds=1000

### Invalid record count returns HTTP 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/local-service/stream?chunks=0
